00:37.450 --> 00:40.420
<b>Omoi wa number 1 star</b>

00:40.520 --> 00:43.490
<b>Kono sora no naka de</b>

00:53.720 --> 00:55.810
<b>What's going on outside nyo?</b>

00:55.920 --> 00:57.450
<b>Hello!</b>

00:55.920 --> 00:57.450
<b>Aba</b>

00:57.660 --> 00:59.280
<b>I'm Abarenbou!</b>

00:59.390 --> 01:01.920
<b>What? I can't hear you
over the noise nyo.</b>

01:02.030 --> 01:03.260
<b>I'm Abarenbou.</b>

01:03.360 --> 01:05.190
<b>Oh, Abarenbou-san nyo?</b>

01:05.300 --> 01:08.290
<b>The sky is so blue today.
It's so great, it lifts my spirits.</b>

01:08.900 --> 01:12.270
<b>I feel like going crazy today.</b>

01:13.140 --> 01:15.470
<b>But don't worry.
Don't worry about me.</b>

01:16.510 --> 01:18.770
<b>Even if I go crazy,
I won't break anything.</b>

01:18.880 --> 01:21.540
<b>That wouldn't be funny
and I'd get in trouble.</b>

01:21.650 --> 01:23.410
<b>I came up with something great.</b>

01:23.520 --> 01:28.450
<b>I came up with something great.
It's amazing.</b>

01:31.890 --> 01:34.690
<b>There are times when you can cry...</b>

01:34.790 --> 01:36.130
<b>What's wrong with him?</b>

01:36.230 --> 01:38.420
<b>I don't know,
but he sounds terrible.</b>

01:38.530 --> 01:39.930
<b>Oh no nyo!</b>

01:40.030 --> 01:43.060
<b>All of the customers are going home
without buying anything nyo.</b>

01:43.170 --> 01:45.030
<b>I have to work harder nyo!</b>

01:45.140 --> 01:47.330
<b>You know, little girl.</b>

01:47.440 --> 01:48.700
<b>Yikes nyo!</b>

01:48.810 --> 01:50.940
<b>It's hard being an Abarenbou.</b>

01:51.040 --> 01:54.450
<b>He's griping, and it's just
like an adult man's gripe.</b>

01:58.990 --> 01:59.950
<b>More please!</b>

02:00.050 --> 02:03.020
<b>This is Gamers!
We don't have food here.</b>

02:03.120 --> 02:04.180
<b>Whaaaat?</b>

02:04.290 --> 02:06.320
<b>Do you want some melon bread?</b>

02:06.660 --> 02:08.220
<b>Thanks, man.</b>

02:08.330 --> 02:10.460
<b>But I don't need no melon bread.
Thank goodness.</b>

02:11.160 --> 02:12.220
<b>Hey everyone.</b>

02:12.330 --> 02:14.230
<b>If we are true to ourselves,</b>

02:14.330 --> 02:17.630
<b>our spirits will shine
and food will taste better.</b>

02:17.740 --> 02:18.970
<b>So let's live honestly.</b>

02:19.210 --> 02:20.970
<b>More please!</b>

02:21.070 --> 02:23.410
<b>We don't have food here!</b>

02:23.510 --> 02:24.480
<b>Leave it to us.</b>

02:24.580 --> 02:25.010
<b>Nyo?</b>

02:25.550 --> 02:27.480
<b>Abarenbou-san,
do you want to eat this?</b>

02:27.580 --> 02:29.570
<b>I brought some rice balls today.</b>

02:29.680 --> 02:31.840
<b>I have some sausage.</b>

02:32.620 --> 02:34.750
<b>Hey guys, thanks!</b>

02:45.270 --> 02:46.630
<b>Ah, good.</b>

02:46.730 --> 02:49.360
<b>Now that I'm full,
I think it's time to go crazy.</b>

02:49.470 --> 02:53.370
<b>If you go crazy, then I will
protect this store from you nyo!</b>

02:53.910 --> 02:56.210
<b>Ah, I already went crazy for today.</b>

02:56.310 --> 02:58.210
<b>I'm done digesting, too.</b>

02:58.680 --> 03:00.650
<b>Thanks for letting me go crazy.</b>

03:01.820 --> 03:03.280
<b>I don't get it nyo.</b>

03:03.380 --> 03:06.480
<b>When did he start going crazy
and when did he stop?</b>

03:06.790 --> 03:08.950
<b>I lost nyo.
I lost to him nyo.</b>

03:09.060 --> 03:10.580
<b>Little girl.</b>

03:13.790 --> 03:17.390
<b>This is a great place.
This is a great store.</b>

03:18.300 --> 03:21.460
<b>I'm not good with words,</b>

03:21.970 --> 03:24.100
<b>but I'm glad I came here.</b>

03:24.200 --> 03:26.430
<b>It's a really great store.</b>

03:27.610 --> 03:29.970
<b>Live long and prosper.</b>

03:32.550 --> 03:34.010
<b>Ciao.</b>

03:35.450 --> 03:36.570
<b>He left.</b>

03:36.680 --> 03:40.120
<b>He is a man of great words gema!</b>

03:40.220 --> 03:41.780
<b>He did nothing nyu.</b>

03:41.890 --> 03:43.950
<b>What?
I thought so!</b>
